# SEO-Analyzer-Pro

> An advanced FastAPI and Tailwind CSS platform for SEO professionals that integrates traditional optimization tools with modern AI search visibility tracking to maximize organic traffic and digital discoverability.

## 🚀 About The Project

**SEO-Analyzer-Pro** is a modern web application and SaaS platform designed to streamline the optimization workflow. It bridges the gap between classic search engine optimization and emerging generative AI search experiences, empowering digital marketers, website owners, and SEO teams to track traditional rankings alongside AI-driven visibility and citations.

## ✨ Key Features

- **All-in-One SEO & AI Workflow:** Combine traditional keyword research and technical audits with modern AI search tracking.
- **AI Visibility Monitoring:** Track brand mentions, citation frequencies, and share of voice across major AI platforms and search experiences.
- **Modern Responsive UI:** Built with FastAPI on the backend and styled using Tailwind CSS for a seamless user experience.
- **Pricing & Subscription Management:** Includes built-in tiers ranging from free trial plans to professional and enterprise options.

## 🛠️ Built With

* **Backend:** [FastAPI](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/), Python
* **Frontend:** Tailwind CSS, HTML5, JavaScript
* **Deployment:** GitHub Pages / Uvicorn

## 🏁 Getting Started

Follow these steps to run the project locally on your machine.

### Prerequisites

Make sure you have Python and pip installed on your system.
